            </article>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ARTICLES -->

    <section>

        <div class="section-header">

            <div>
                <h2>Price Watch</h2>

                <p>
                    Information to help consumers understand price changes
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="article-grid">

            <article class="article">

                <div class="article-label">
                    Price Watch
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Why fuel prices can affect household expenses
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Fuel is used for transportation and the
                    movement of goods. Changes in fuel prices
                    may affect transportation and delivery costs,
                    which can influence household expenses.
                </p>

                <a href="#fuel">
                    Read article →
                </a>

            </article>


            <article class="article">

                <div class="article-label">
                    Budgeting
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Check prices before going to the market
                </h3>

